  m_text: 'Welcome to Pet Sim!


    Look at objects with the ray.

    Press X to
    open object menus.

    Press B to select highlighted menu options.

    Press
    Y to teleport.

    Press A to place held objects or spawn removed objects.

    Use
    the phone to call the veterinarian.

    Keep your cat fed, hydrated, rested,
    clean, and happy.


    Press OK to begin.'
